{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":52,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. A contemplation by David, when Doeg the Edomite came and told Saul, “David has come to Ahimelech’s house.”"},{"n":1,"text":"Why do you boast of mischief, mighty man? God’s loving kindness endures continually.","tok":[{"t":"Why do you boast "},{"t":"of","s":["H4905"]},{"t":" mischief, mighty man? God’s loving kindness endures continually."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Your tongue plots destruction, like a sharp razor, working deceitfully.","tok":[{"t":"Your","s":["H5046"]},{"t":" tongue plots destruction, "},{"t":"like","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" sharp razor, working deceitfully."}]},{"n":3,"text":"You love evil more than good, lying rather than speaking the truth. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"love","s":["H2617"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[1]},{"t":" more "},{"t":"than","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2617"]},{"t":", lying rather "},{"t":"than","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" speaking "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" truth. Selah."}]},{"n":4,"text":"You love all devouring words, you deceitful tongue.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H6213"]},{"t":" love "},{"t":"all","s":["H6213"]},{"t":" devouring words, "},{"t":"you","s":["H6213"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"deceitful","s":["H7423"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tongue","s":["H3956"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"God will likewise destroy you forever. He will take you up, and pluck you out of your tent, and root you out of the land of the living. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"God "},{"t":"will","s":["H6664"]},{"t":" likewise destroy "},{"t":"you","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" forever. "},{"t":"He","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H6664"]},{"t":" take "},{"t":"you","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" up, "},{"t":"and","s":["H2896"]},{"t":" pluck "},{"t":"you","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"out","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" tent, "},{"t":"and","s":["H2896"]},{